{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pulls/3939","id":4916342307,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU-508s8AAAABJQluIw","html_url":"https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/3939","diff_url":"https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/3939.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/3939.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/issues/3939","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pulls/3939/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pulls/3939/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/issues/3939/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/statuses/d4d6a1fbe8165785ab6d43a68619d12a371813b4","number":3939,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Conditional κ = 0.001734865178472710998233 (+0.00109%): pooled R438 slack across bit replicas on #3934, complex binds again","user":{"login":"rohanarun","id":11659839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjU5ODM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11659839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun","html_url":"https://github.com/rohanarun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Conditional κ = `0.001734865178472710998233 − 10⁻⁴⁶ − 10⁻⁷⁰`, which is **+0.00109% over #3934** (0.001734846264120199151475). **Draft: full verification is running.**\n\n| | complex endpoint | bit endpoint | binds | κ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| #3934 | 0.0017348651784727109982331 | R438 0.001734846264120199151475 | bit | 0.001734846264120199151475 − … |\n| **this** | 0.0017348651784727109982331 | **pooled R438 0.001734900431583947157341** | **complex** | **0.001734865178472710998233 − …** |\n\n## Idea\n\n#3934 made the bit side bind at R438's endpoint. R438 is #1043's word with #2423's re-hosting. It leaves 54 width-8 slack units per replica, and its proven replica-local optimum is 10 empty capacity-42 copies plus one capacity-42 copy holding one residual (idle 34).\n\nPooling across the 32 replicas gives `32·54 = 345·5 + 3`. That makes the pooled32 optimum 345 empty 42-copies plus one empty 28-copy, with value 0.001734900431583947 (`bit-partial-width7-optimum`, k = 1 row). Both that package and seed72 leave open whether a **cross-replica owner map** can realize it. The complex T16 supplier already uses such maps (`owner_replica ≠ replica`).\n\nThis PR builds that map explicitly from R438's own placement. It makes 35 moves:\n- the 32 single residuals (one per replica, child 6);\n- the 3 residuals of one full capacity-28 copy of replica 0 (child 7, stages 5–8, inside child 6's window 3–8).\n\nThese go into 7 previously empty child-6 copies, five per copy. The idle bill changes by `{2:+7, 4:−1, 28:+1, 34:−32, 42:+25}`. Mass, child count and maxchild 42 are unchanged.\n\n## Verification\n\n`research/rank7-pooled-r438-bit/verify.py` runs in about 7 s and is independent of `build.py`.\n- **Placement binding.** `ALLOC-R438.json.gz` matches `slot_list_sha256` in R438's rehost receipt on main.\n- **Role audit.** All 126,144 roles are rebuilt and audited: windows, inactive host pairs, extents, cells, compact prefixes, and once-only hosting.\n- **Baseline check.** The baseline equals the R438 certificate profile and endpoint.\n- **Pooled endpoint.** It is accepted at c and rejected at c + 10⁻²⁴, with the fallback envelope.\n- **Composition.** #3934's complex root is rechecked, and `κ = min(floor₂₄(complex), floor₂₄(bit)) − …`.\n- **Controls.** 6 mutation controls are rejected.\n\n`scripts/research_package.py` passes locally under Python 3.12. This PR stacks on #3934.\n\n## Scope\n\nNew hypothesis: the bit supplier may use a cross-replica owner map. The slot rules are audited, but #1043's native hosted emission (C++17/Boost) has not been run. This is conditional on R438 (#1043 is open) and on the whole #3934 stack.\n\nCredits: Ali Romman (#1043), Sagar Thakrar (#2423), mightyOil (#1281 pooled32 optimum), seed72/seed14 (windows, placement), #1023 (slot model), and the #3934 stack's credits, including OpenCode (Space bunny free). Prepared by Rohan Arun with Anthropic Claude assistance.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011S35E2acyQDaVRjPRw4TDy","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-19T05:31:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:31:14Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9ed952e588fb7f1ad9bdaef1b206a2f5a9adb5d4","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"rohanarun:rank7-pooled-r438-bit","ref":"rank7-pooled-r438-bit","repo":{"id":1409919887,"node_id":"R_kgDOVAmrjw","name":"integer-mult-bounds","full_name":"rohanarun/integer-mult-bounds","owner":{"login":"rohanarun","id":11659839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjU5ODM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11659839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun","html_url":"https://github.com/rohanarun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/followers","following_url":"https://ap